# How to Add a New Component

New course phase components start from
[prompt-edu/prompt-example-phase](https://github.com/prompt-edu/prompt-example-phase). Run this
from the repository root:

```sh
make new-phase NAME=<name> CLIENT_PORT=<port> SERVER_PORT=<port>
```

It downloads the example phase, renames it, and registers the component and its server in this
repository. The full guide, including the manual steps and phases developed outside this
repository, is `docs/contributor/new_course_phase.md`.
